“As many as do not persevere but turn away, their names He blots out, not from wrath but from justice.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0103527.htm
)

“The Book of Life admits no false converts; those who mock grace write themselves out by their own will.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/0320.htm
)

“To lose the Book of Life is to lose the Bridegroom Himself; those who live unrepentant erase their own remembrance from Heaven.”
(Source: https://www.newadvent.org/fathers/050655.htm
)
